  "subtitle": "Stir-fried noodles with chicken and vegetables",
  "excerpt": "Chow mein is a Cantonese stir-fried noodle dish that goes from cold ingredients to table in under 20 minutes. The trick is very high heat and keeping everything moving so the noodles catch some colour without sticking. This is a proper weeknight dinner.",
